{
  "description": "Strokes against each platform's default bindings (the keybindings of design/generated/registry.json, which internal/keybindings writes): each gives none (the key reaches the program in the terminal on its first press) or run:<command>. No default is a chord, so ctrl+b and every key that is not a default give none. Run by web/src/__tests__/keys.test.ts.",
